{
 "item": "CAP-X8ROWS3-PREDICTED",
 "from": "x8-group-height, after CAP-X8ROWS and CAP-X8ROWS2, before any read of CAP-X8ROWS3. The last round the cap allows.",
 "question": "X8: C4, fitted on all earlier reads. k = new cells / old cells, exact, per axis. From the side of the box that stays, a block near line goes to round(D*k) and its far line to round((D-1)*k + K), K = ceil(k - 0.5). A half goes to the larger line number, so down or right. A block keeps at least 1 cell, inside the box. No separate rule for an edge on the box. Tables give [start, end] per block, in cells from the box top or left. p, q, y: south, new shapes. r: north with ties at k = 0.5 and 1.5. s: east. t: west with ties. u: corner drops, as grid areas. v (Button), w (Text), x (a phone) are predicted by the same formula from each one start read: Text and Button may keep their own rows, and any miss there is named by type.",
 "model": "# C4: k = new cells / old cells, exact. From the side that stays (anchor), a block's near line goes to round(D*k)\n# and its far line to round((D-1)*k + K), where K = ceil(k - .5). Halves go to the larger line number, right or down.\nE9=1e-9\ndef K(k): return math.ceil(k-.5-E9)\ndef hup(x): return math.floor(x+.5+E9)\ndef hdn(x): return math.ceil(x-.5-E9)\ndef axis(s,e,B0,B1,N0,N1,neg=False):\n    k=(N1-N0)/(B1-B0)\n    if not neg:\n        a=N0+hup((s-B0)*k); b=N0+hup((e-1-B0)*k+K(k))\n        b=max(b,a+1)\n        if b>N1: a,b=N1-1,N1\n    else:\n        b=N1-hdn((B1-e)*k); a=N1-hdn((B1-s-1)*k+K(k))\n        a=min(a,b-1)\n        if a<N0: a,b=N0,N0+1\n    return a,b\n",
